    ],
    "text": "THE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) AS AMENDED BY THE LAND ACQUISITION (AMENDEMENT) ACT No. 28 OF 1964 Notice under Section 07 My Reference No.: DIK/LAN/02/60. I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 07, of the Land Acquisition Act, No. 28 of 1964 (Amendement) that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose. Description of the land to be acquired:- Following lands mentioned in the preliminary plan No. 2797 of Surveyor General Matara and situated in village of Belideniya, Grama Niladhari Division of Belideniya in Dickwella Divisional Secretariat of Matara District. 1. Lot No. 01 Name of the land: Mataraaththannehena Alias Mataraattannewatta; Description: Home Garden, there is a mix cultivation; Claimed by: Gamini Wijendra, Belideniya, Kottagoda; Extent: 0.3103 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
